lowestTermValuation -- The valuation defined by lowest terms
************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        v = lowestTermValuation
  * Inputs:
      * R, a *note polynomial ring: (Macaulay2Doc)PolynomialRing,, the ring
        whose term order is used to define the valuation
  * Outputs:
      * v, an instance of the type *note Valuation: Valuation,, the lowest term
        valuation

Description
===========

This function builds a valuation which returns the exponent vector of the lead
term of a polynomial with respect to the ring's term order. The valuation
returns vectors in an ordered $\QQ$-module, which respects the monomial order
of the *note PolynomialRing: (Macaulay2Doc)PolynomialRing,. For more details
see *note Ordered modules: Ordered modules,.

+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[a,b,c, MonomialOrder => Lex];                    |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : vR = lowestTermValuation R;                             |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : f = 13*a^2*b + a*c^3;                                   |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : g = 5*a^2*c + b^3;                                      |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : vR f                                                    |
|                                                             |
|o5 = | 1 |                                                   |
|     | 0 |                                                   |
|     | 3 |                                                   |
|                                                             |
|o5 : Ordered QQ^3 module                                     |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : vR f < vR g                                             |
|                                                             |
|o6 = false                                                   |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : S = QQ[a,b,c, MonomialOrder => RevLex, Global => false];|
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : vS = lowestTermValuation S;                             |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : f = 13*a^2*b + a*c^3;                                   |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : g = 5*a^2*c + b^3;                                     |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i11 : vS f                                                   |
|                                                             |
|o11 = | 2 |                                                  |
|      | 1 |                                                  |
|      | 0 |                                                  |
|                                                             |
|o11 : Ordered QQ^3 module                                    |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i12 : vS f < vS g                                            |
|                                                             |
|o12 = true                                                   |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+

