padicValuation -- The p-adic valuation
**************************************

  * Usage: 
        v = padicValuation(p)
  * Inputs:
      * p, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, a prime
  * Outputs:
      * v, an instance of the type *note Valuation: Valuation,, p-adic
        valuation using prime p

Description
===========

This function constructs a valuation which returns the number of times that $p$
divides the numerator minus the number of times that $p$ divides the
denominator.

+--------------------------+
|i1 : v = padicValuation 7;|
+--------------------------+
|i2 : v 98                 |
|                          |
|o2 = 2                    |
+--------------------------+
|i3 : v (2/7)              |
|                          |
|o3 = -1                   |
+--------------------------+
|i4 : v 0                  |
|                          |
|o4 = infinity             |
|                          |
|o4 : InfiniteNumber       |
+--------------------------+
|i5 : v (-42)              |
|                          |
|o5 = 1                    |
+--------------------------+

